<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 24.5pt">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_90F_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20251117__20251117_z8oiXdMNLda8"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-11-17" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 24.5pt">If an emerging growth company that prepares its
financial statements in accordance with U.S. GAAP, indicate by check mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition
period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting standard provided pursuant to Section 7(a)(2)(B) of the Securities Act.&#160;<span style="font-family: Wingdings">&#168;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>The Registrant hereby amends this Registration Statement on such
date or dates as may be necessary to delay its effective date until the Registrant shall file a further amendment which specifically states
that this Registration Statement shall thereafter become effective in accordance with Section&#160;8(a) of the Securities Act or until
the Registration Statement shall become effective on such date as the Commission, acting pursuant to said Section&#160;8(a), may determine.
</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

