    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td>$</td>
    <td style="text-align: right">(6.96</td>
    <td style="white-space: nowrap">)</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="padding-left: 0.25in; text-indent: 9pt">As adjusted net tangible book value per Depositary Share as of June 30, 2025, after giving effect to this offering</td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: black 1pt solid">$</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; text-align: right"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">5.86</p></td>
    <td style="white-space: nowrap"/></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td>Accretion per Depositary Share to the investors in this offering</td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: black 2.25pt double">$</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: black 2.25pt double; text-align: right">0.53</td>
    <td style="white-space: nowrap">&#160;</td></tr>
  </table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">A $1.00 increase in the assumed combined public offering price of $5.33&#160;per
Unit would increase the as adjusted net tangible book value per Depositary Share by $0.79 and increase the accretion per Depositary Share
to investors participating in this offering by $0.79, assuming no sale of any Pre-Funded Units and no exercise of the Series L Warrants
and Placement Agent Warrants, and after deducting estimated placement agent fees and estimated offering expenses payable by us. A $1.00&#160;decrease
in the assumed combined public offering price of $5.33 per Unit would decrease the as adjusted net tangible book value per Depositary
Share by $0.79&#160;and decrease the accretion per Depositary Share to investors participating in this offering by $0.79, assuming no
sale of any Units containing Pre-Funded Warrants and no exercise of the Series L Warrants and Placement Agent Warrants, and after deducting
estimated placement agent fees and estimated offering expenses payable by us.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">For purposes of this section,
the share information above excludes:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

