rules and regulations promulgated thereunder.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white; color: #212529"><i>Stock
dividends and stock splits.</i>&#160;If we pay a stock dividend or otherwise make a distribution payable in Depositary Shares or Ordinary
